	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo Cyberthink\n\nSeptember 3, 2020\nCyberthink\nNew York, NY 10017\nRe: VR 3D Developer\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Virtual Reality Developer. \nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a strong fit for this work, including experience with Unity and Virtual Reality.  \nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge and interest in virtual reality…",
